### ============================================
### CRUD DE PROPIETARIOS - GestionInmobiliaria
### ============================================
### Obtener token desde Auth.http -> Login

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5005
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..69Enf0q3_sTQqRulRzQcF27ZtMLWuXb9qsE_weztCeQ

### ============================================
### CONSULTAS (READ)
### ============================================

### 1. Obtener todos los propietarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Filtrar por nombre/apellido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios?buscar=garcia
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Solo activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios?activo=true
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Obtener propietario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================
### CREAR (POST)
### ============================================

### 5. Crear propietario completo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "García",
  "dni": "25123456",
  "cuit": "20-25123456-3",
  "email": "carlos.garcia@gmail.com",
  "telefono": "11-4567-8901",
  "telefono2": "11-9876-5432",
  "direccion": "Av. Corrientes 1234, CABA",
  "cbu": "0000003100012345678901",
  "notas": "Propietario puntual, prefiere contacto por WhatsApp"
}

###

### 6. Crear propietario mínimo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "María",
  "apellido": "López"
}

###

### ============================================
### ACTUALIZAR (PUT)
### ============================================

### 7. Actualizar propietario
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "García",
  "dni": "25123456",
  "cuit": "20-25123456-3",
  "email": "carlos.garcia@hotmail.com",
  "telefono": "11-4567-8901",
  "telefono2": "11-1111-2222",
  "direccion": "Av. Santa Fe 5678, CABA",
  "cbu": "0000003100012345678901",
  "notas": "Actualizado"
}

###

### ============================================
### ELIMINAR (DELETE - baja lógica)
### ============================================

### 8. Dar de baja propietario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
